  "finding": "Natir/Dragon pure effect-negation responses no longer opt into Damage Step/calculation. Revelation retains before-calculation Damage Step permission for its direct ATK gain, removes calculation permission and rejects post-calculation Damage Step. Nine original-effect/native timing cases pass with actual Man-Eater Bug normal Flip Summon versus battle flip, actual Catastor start-of-Damage-Step destruction, and original Injection Fairy Lily damage-calculation activation/payment/ATK boost. Exact old source offers five forbidden responses. Omitted negation fails four actual negate/payment/ATK outcomes; omitted Revelation post-calculation guard and removed legitimate early permission each fail one.",
  "qualification": "Full original source/current installed metadata; source Synchros and Catastor field-seeded, original recipes not tested. Full original Man-Eater Bug/Injection Fairy Lily/Catastor effects and actual battles. Natir explicit established CHAININFO_TARGET_CARDS=8 test mapping; Catastor explicit pure-attribute IsNonAttribute polarity mapping, with unadapted failures preserved. No production API replacements. Other clauses/named sharing/reset/live Omega remain open.",
